%% A passenger's ride request. The pool (Bullet's trip) moves accepted -> driver_arrived -> started -> dropped_off -> completed.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> requested: passenger books
  requested --> matched: driver accepts (joins or opens a pool)
  matched --> driver_arrived: driver marks arrival
  driver_arrived --> started: driver starts
  started --> dropped_off: driver drops riders off
  dropped_off --> completed: driver completes, once every rider has paid
  requested --> cancelled: passenger cancels
  matched --> cancelled: passenger cancels, seat returned
  driver_arrived --> cancelled: passenger cancels, seat returned
  completed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
